<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets NZ$100 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets NZ$100 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank and Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    23.JUL.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.625   PAY DATE    23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/A+    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/UK/NL/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   0.875</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
